{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20108",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.84,
      "end_seconds": 4.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I think it's my turn."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.3,
      "end_seconds": 10.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.27,
      "end_seconds": 20.53,
      "duration_seconds": 9.26,
      "text": "hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay. We came because of a sore throat"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.56,
      "end_seconds": 24.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.21,
      "end_seconds": 36.27,
      "duration_seconds": 10.06,
      "text": "um, it's been going on for three days i just want to get back to normal, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.13,
      "end_seconds": 42.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.49,
      "end_seconds": 51.67,
      "duration_seconds": 7.18,
      "text": "It settles a little with warm drinks. It's mild, honestly. It's worse with swallowing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.54,
      "end_seconds": 59.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Have you had pain on swallowing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.73,
      "end_seconds": 67.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "Yes, I have. I've also had swollen glands in my neck, for one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.12,
      "end_seconds": 74.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.02,
      "text": "Have you had a sore throat before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.25,
      "end_seconds": 81.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "let me think, a bit, last winter it settled by itself back then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.45,
      "end_seconds": 85.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "And what about cough, drooling or ear pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.4,
      "end_seconds": 91.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "I haven't had cough, drooling or ear pain, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.17,
      "end_seconds": 96.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "mm, okay okay, have you had any trouble opening the mouth?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.89,
      "end_seconds": 100.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "No. No trouble opening the mouth."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.0,
      "end_seconds": 104.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Any difficulty breathing or rash at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.37,
      "end_seconds": 108.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.89,
      "end_seconds": 113.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.81,
      "end_seconds": 120.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Um, no, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.06,
      "end_seconds": 125.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Okay, which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 127.11,
      "end_seconds": 130.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "She takes simvastatin, at night for my cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.3,
      "end_seconds": 133.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 134.37,
      "end_seconds": 144.43,
      "duration_seconds": 10.06,
      "text": "20 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box. So, she takes clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.7,
      "end_seconds": 150.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Mm, I used to take atorvastatin, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.78,
      "end_seconds": 154.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.5,
      "end_seconds": 165.27,
      "duration_seconds": 9.77,
      "text": "I, I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.09,
      "end_seconds": 170.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.84,
      "end_seconds": 179.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "My uncle has high cholesterol. Let me think, my sister had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.01,
      "end_seconds": 184.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "what operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.28,
      "end_seconds": 193.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.74,
      "text": "Yes, uh, I had a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.9,
      "end_seconds": 198.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.82,
      "end_seconds": 211.84,
      "duration_seconds": 12.02,
      "text": "Actually, I've had diabetes for nearly five years now. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot. I've got high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.01,
      "end_seconds": 214.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Hm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.56,
      "end_seconds": 217.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "I've got heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.52,
      "end_seconds": 221.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Yes. Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.57,
      "end_seconds": 227.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.91,
      "end_seconds": 230.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.0,
      "end_seconds": 235.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.6,
      "end_seconds": 239.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.11,
      "end_seconds": 243.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.36,
      "end_seconds": 254.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "let's start with the basic checks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.19,
      "end_seconds": 266.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.16,
      "end_seconds": 286.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 105, pressure 125 over 75, temperature is 38.2 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.47,
      "end_seconds": 291.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.96,
      "end_seconds": 311.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "fine by me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.08,
      "end_seconds": 315.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "hold that for a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.71,
      "end_seconds": 330.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "Both tonsils are red and enlarged with white patches, and the neck glands are tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.84,
      "end_seconds": 333.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "fine by me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.36,
      "end_seconds": 345.95,
      "duration_seconds": 10.59,
      "text": "you can relax now. Let me tell you where I've got to. The most likely explanation is tonsillitis. Glandular fever is also on my list"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.56,
      "end_seconds": 349.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Is it it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.26,
      "end_seconds": 357.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now tonsillitis is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.79,
      "end_seconds": 387.0,
      "duration_seconds": 12.21,
      "text": "I'm sending you for a throat swab because of sore throat. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.84,
      "end_seconds": 390.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "How long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.38,
      "end_seconds": 413.55,
      "duration_seconds": 22.17,
      "text": "What I'm giving you is phenoxymethylpenicillin, 500 milligrams, four times a day, for ten days. You take it by mouth. That should help with tonsillitis. Gargle with warm salt water and drink plenty of fluids. We'll catch up if it isn't better in three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 414.86,
      "end_seconds": 416.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "That's fine with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 417.55,
      "end_seconds": 420.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "I think we're done unless you have questions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 422.59,
      "end_seconds": 426.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}